From: Siv3D
Subject: [PATCH] ert.h: include <cstdint> for fixed-width integer types

GCC 13+/Clang 16+ no longer transitively declare uint8_t/uint32_t through the
C++ standard headers ert.h already includes, so the bare uint8_t in
ert::color_rgba fails to compile. Include <cstdint> explicitly.
---
 ert.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/ert.h b/ert.h
index 0000000..0000001 100644
--- a/ert.h
+++ b/ert.h
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include <time.h>
 #include <vector>
 #include <string>
+#include <cstdint>

 namespace ert
 {
